This library includes material from the following sources.

==============================================================================
web-platform-tests
==============================================================================

This software includes test data copied from web-platform-tests
(https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt), from its url/resources
directory at commit 13748c36fdf9dd77cd0b34dd6b244256b365ea60: URL parsing,
setter, IDNA, and percent-encoding test cases, in tests/wpt/ and in the
tests generated from them in src/. From its url directory at the same
commit: the search parameter tests (urlencoded-parser.any.js,
url-searchparams.any.js, and urlsearchparams-*.any.js), in tests/wpt/,
in the tests generated from them in src/, and ported by hand in
src/search-params.temper.md. The URL parsing it tests follows the
WHATWG URL Standard (https://url.spec.whatwg.org/).

