==============================================================================
Chromium
==============================================================================

This software includes data copied from Chromium
(https://github.com/chromium/chromium), at commit
71eb2d8d6c1e036e26c3b1a912242cb11c5d019c, for deciding when a host is
shown in Unicode: from components/url_formatter/spoof_checks/
idn_spoof_checker.cc, the letters of each script that look like Latin
ones, the top-level domains that allow them, the Cyrillic words allowed
anyway, the digit look-alikes, the code points removed from the allowed
set, and the code points of the dangerous patterns; and from
skeleton_generator.cc in the same directory, the Latin letters it maps to
ASCII ones. They are in scripts/display_tables.py, in the tables
generated from it in src/display-tables.temper.md, and in
src/display.temper.md, whose rules are reimplemented from those files and
components/url_formatter/url_formatter.cc.

