Unicode Character Database, UTS #46 (IDNA), and UTS #39 data
==============================================================================

This software includes data derived from Unicode 18.0.0's data files
(https://www.unicode.org/Public/18.0.0/): IdnaMappingTable.txt,
UnicodeData.txt, DerivedNormalizationProps.txt, DerivedBidiClass.txt,
DerivedJoiningType.txt, Scripts.txt, and ScriptExtensions.txt, and the
security data of UTS #39 (Unicode Security Mechanisms): IdentifierStatus.txt
and confusables.txt, in the tables generated from them in src/. The
files themselves aren't included; scripts/unicode_data.py downloads them.
